# The Clerk's PDFs (98 MB) and the extracted rows are both derived and
# re-fetchable: `fetch_sfbos_minutes.py --fetch --extract`. The CALENDAR is not
# derived — it is the measurement, 2,670 weekdays probed against sfbos.org on a
# given day — so it is versioned, and so is the gap list it produces.
pdf/
items.jsonl

# The FULL sweep (sweep_sfbos_all.py): every item in the 390 PDFs, 33 MB, and
# the pool derived from it. Both are derived and reproducible in ~20 seconds
# from the PDFs above: `sweep_sfbos_all.py --sweep --pool`. The calendar stays
# versioned for the same reason as before: it is a measurement, not a derivation.
items_all.jsonl
items_all.meta.json
film_pool.jsonl
